-This design avoids the trap of trying to keep a single global ANN graph perfectly up-to-date under continuous writes. Instead, we make the hot path boring: append a WAL, build small immutable segments, and periodically compact. The hard parts become well-scoped: filtered ANN retrieval and segment compaction without latency cliffs.
