 ### Components
 
-- `Ingest API`: validates vectors/metadata, batches writes, and enforces collection schemas (dims, distance metric, indexed fields). Earns its place by keeping shard nodes focused on search, not validation.
-- `WAL + Memtable`: durable append log + in-memory table of recent upserts/deletes. This is the only “mutable truth” in the hot path; everything else can be rebuilt.
